      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Small field but several win chances. VERBOSITY (2) has been racing away from home but has a good record here and freshened for the sharper trip. Has the claim and the inside draw. Won't find a better opportunity to return to winning form. DOWN THE WICKET (4) has been bursting to win placing four of last five starts. Wound up strongly last time and should go close again. ROCK OF KRYPTONITE (1) ran very well fresh when placed in open class. Drops in grade for this and fitter again. Was a second-up winner last time in and can repeat the dose with the right run. DYER (3) is an SA galloper resuming and has won fresh. Best figures stack up to this class so is a big watch. MISS TOP GUN (6) is close to a win and expected to play a significant role.",
